{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50604","headline":"奉和纪朝臣公咏雪诗 · 杨泰师","name":"奉和纪朝臣公咏雪诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜龙云（一作「楼」）上，今朝鹤雪新。\n只（一作「怪」）看花发树，不听鸟惊春。\n回影疑神女，高歌似郢人。\n幽兰难可继，更欲效而嚬。\n（同前引《经国集》十三。\n）（按《续日本纪》云：「宝字三年正月，大保藤原惠美朝臣押胜安蕃客於田村第，当代文士赋诗送别，副使扬泰师作诗和之。\n」宝字，系日本淳仁天皇年号，即天平宝字。\n天平宝字三年，当唐肃宗乾元二年，渤海文王大兴二十二年。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨泰师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50604.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50604","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}